      "text": "SILICA SAND      SODA ASH       LIMESTONE      CULLET\n  (SiO₂ 70-75%)   (Na₂CO₃ →     (CaCO₃ →       (recycled glass\n  Iron <0.015%     Na₂O 14%)      CaO 10%)        50-90% in EU)\n       |                |               |               |\n       +————————————————+———————————————+———————————————+\n                        |\n                   BATCH MIXING\n                        |\n               FURNACE MELTING\n               (~1,500°C; continuous;\n                10-15 year campaign)\n                        |\n          ——————————————+——————————————\n          |             |             |\n       FLOAT          BLOW/       DRAW/PRESS\n       (flat glass)   MOLD        (fiber, containers,\n          |           (bottles,    shaped glass)\n          |           vessels)          |\n     ANNEALING LEHR                ANNEALING\n     (controlled slow cooling)          |\n          |                        FINISHING\n     CUTTING / COATINGS            (cutting, grinding,\n     (Low-E, solar control,         polishing, coating)\n      self-cleaning)                     |\n          |                        SECONDARY PROCESS\n          +—————————————————————————————+\n                        |\n              SECONDARY PROCESSING\n              (tempering, laminating,\n               insulating glass units,\n               further coating)\n                        |\n                   END PRODUCT\n              (windows, containers, fiber,\n               displays, automotive, solar)\n```"
