      "text": "CRYSTALLINE SOLID:         GLASS:              LIQUID:\n  Ordered atoms              Disordered atoms     Free atoms\n  Sharp melting point        No melting point     Flows at any shear\n  Discontinuous at Tm        Gradual Tg range     rate (viscosity\n  (volume, entropy jump)     (viscosity changes)  ∝ temperature)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#017",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
