      "text": "VISCOSITY LADDER (soda-lime glass):\n Temperature  Viscosity       Behavior\n ———————————  ———————————     ——————————————————————————\n ~1,500°C     ~10 Pa·s        Molten — pourable, homogeneous melt\n ~1,100°C     ~10³ Pa·s       Working point — blowing/pressing/drawing\n ~720°C       ~10⁷·⁶ Pa·s    Softening point — deforms under own weight\n ~550°C       ~10¹²·⁴ Pa·s   Annealing point — stresses relax in minutes\n ~515°C       ~10¹³·⁸ Pa·s   Strain point — below here, stresses fixed\n Room temp    ~10²¹+ Pa·s    Solid; rigid on any practical timescale"
    },
